# Host files these suites cannot load without, as paths relative to the
# Minerva checkout root. scripts/run-gd-tests.sh checks every one of them
# before it starts Godot (and under --preflight-only, which is what CI runs),
# so a bumped Minerva SHA that drops a helper fails by NAME instead of as an
# opaque "Cannot open file res://..." twenty lines into the first suite.
#
# src/project.godot is required for every plugin and is checked
# unconditionally by the runner; it is not repeated here.
#
# Both driver helpers are generic Minerva test scaffolding, not pcb's: 9
# relocated suites preload plugin_panel_driver.gd and 7 preload
# panel_tool_registry_driver.gd. They live in the host
# because they drive host-side plugin panels; this file only records that pcb
# depends on them.
src/test/helpers/plugin_panel_driver.gd
src/test/helpers/panel_tool_registry_driver.gd
